#: data/maps/SlateportCity_Mart/scripts.inc:35
msgctxt "SlateportCity_Mart_Text_SomeItemsOnlyAtMart"
msgid ""
"The MARKET does have some interesting\n"
"merchandise.\p"
"But there are some items you can only\n"
"get at a POKéMON MART.$"
msgstr ""
"凯那市场里确实有些有趣的商品。\p"
"不过有些道具只有在友好商店才能买到。$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_Mart/scripts.inc:41
msgctxt "SlateportCity_Mart_Text_GreatBallIsBetter"
msgid ""
"A GREAT BALL is better than a POKé BALL\n"
"at catching POKéMON.\p"
"With this, I should be able to get that\n"
"elusive POKéMON…$"
msgstr ""
"超级球比精灵球更容易抓到宝可梦。\p"
"有了它，我应该就\n"
"能抓到那只难以捉摸的宝可梦了……$"
